<p>Hoarfrost now has additional effects:</p><ul><li> if friendly: magical and physical saves increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 16, 21, 26, 30,</acronym> at level 5 healing factor is also increased by 15%.</li><li> if hostile: magical and physical saves reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 16, 21, 26, 30,</acronym> at level 5 all talents cool down 15% slower.</li></ul><p></p>